  "prefLabel": "Mhp 305.04 Examination for Mental Health Counselors",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mhp 305.04 Examination for Mental Health Counselors. All applicants for licensure shall register for the National Clinical Mental Health Counselor Exam distributed by the National Board of Certified Counselors, and request the testing organization to transmit the examination results directly to the licensing bureau, as required by Plc 303.03.\n\nSource. #10857, eff 6-24-15 (from Mhp 302.19); ss by #14464, eff 2-17-26, EXPIRES 2-17-36",
